<https://w3id.org/ontostart/pizza/> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "An OWL ontology for the pizza domain, built incrementally through the SULO Pizza Tutorial. Covers spatial composition, qualities, quantities, processes, information entities, time, and spatial containment." .
